text = "[color=#ffe066] OBJECTIVE:[/color]
• 1 [color=#ff4c4c]CHASER[/color] vs up to 3 [color=#4fc3f7]RUNNERS[/color].
• [color=#ff4c4c]Chaser[/color] must tag all runners to freeze them into ice blocks!
• [color=#4fc3f7]Runners[/color] survive 180 seconds or unfreeze frozen teammates by touching them!

[color=#ffe066] ITEMS (Collect & press [E] to use):[/color]
•  [b]Speed Boost[/b]: Move 1.6x faster for 6s.
•  [b]Ghost Mode[/b]: Pass through walls for 4.5s!
• ️ [b]Shield[/b]: Blocks 1 tag attempt.
•  [b]Heater[/b]: Unfreeze instantly + temporary immunity.
•  [b]Banana[/b]: Trap that slips & stuns players for 2.5s!
•  [b]Black Hole[/b]: Vortex that pulls nearby players!

[color=#ffe066] CONTROLS:[/color]
• WASD / Arrow Keys: Move
• E Key: Use Held Item"

